{56}{Well... [He is about to say something but then seems to change his mind] Listen, I am harangued and harassed by the TTM at every turn just for selling minor magickal artifacts. If I was selling contraband items they'd hang me in a heartbeat! For all I know you are their latest recruit come to fit me for the noose!}{Well... [He is about to say something but then seems to change his mind] Listen, I am harangued and harassed by the TTM at every turn just for selling minor magickal artifacts. If I was selling contraband items they'd hang me in a heartbeat! For all I know you are their latest recruit come to fit me for the noose!}{}{}{}{}
