{64}{The Tarantian Technological Millitia. He draws the half moon of the Lesser Curse in the air when he speaks their name.] Thugs and brigands secretly in the employ of the Industrial Council! They aim to destroy all magick within the confines of Tarant. They rob travellers of magickal items like any common highwayman and claim it is to keep Tarant's industries free from supernatural sabotage.}{The Tarantian Technological Millitia. He draws the half moon of the Lesser Curse in the air when he speaks their name.] Thugs and brigands secretly in the employ of the Industrial Council! They aim to destroy all magick within the confines of Tarant. They rob travellers of magickal items like any common highwayman and claim it is to keep Tarant's industries free from supernatural sabotage.}{}{}{}{}
