{78}{[He runs a sceptical eye over you] Very well. [He retrieves a small chest from below the counter and whispers into the lock. There is a click and the lid springs open to reveal two gold and white globes.] These are the Personal Teleport Stones of the great mage TONGSyaBASS. With them you can set a location almost anywhere on the continent and return whenever you wish.}{[He runs a sceptical eye over you] Very well. [He retrieves a small chest from below the counter and whispers into the lock. There is a click and the lid springs open to reveal two gold and white globes.] These are the Personal Teleport Stones of the great mage TONGSyaBASS. With them you can set a location almost anywhere on the continent and return whenever you wish.}{}{}{}{}
