{87}{Regrettably, no. There is an inherent flaw with the gems that renders them useless inside caves, cellars, sewers, or even large stone structures. The spell can only carry you through the air - not through soil or thick stone walls. You can, however, set a location in the outside world you'd like to return to and the Use Stone will transport you back there as often as you wish.}{Regrettably, no. There is an inherent flaw with the gems that renders them useless inside caves, cellars, sewers, or even large stone structures. The spell can only carry you through the air - not through soil or thick stone walls. You can, however, set a location in the outside world you'd like to return to and the Use Stone will transport you back there as often as you wish.}{}{}{}{}
