{93}{He was a great scripter of spells and enchantments who mysteriously disappeared one day and hasn't been heard from since. I am not surprised that you haven't hear of him as he was a private individual. I've heard, and this is just a rumor, that he was working on a way to use magic to enhance the power of technology. But, again, that is just a rumor.}{He was a great scripter of spells and enchantments who mysteriously disappeared one day and hasn't been heard from since. I am not surprised that you haven't hear of him as he was a private individual. I've heard, and this is just a rumor, that he was working on a way to use magic to enhance the power of technology. But, again, that is just a rumor.}{}{}{}{}
